  Most used: idx_category_price_rating (45 ops, serves Q1 (prefix), Q5 (ESR)).
  Q1 and Q5 share it through the {category, price} prefix, so one well-ordered
  compound index carries the two most frequent category queries.
  Unused secondary indexes: none -- any listed here are drop candidates.
  _id_ shows 0 ops; it is mandatory and cannot be dropped, whatever its usage.
  Note: $indexStats counters reset when mongod restarts or an index is rebuilt.

